    "transcript": "AI: Lakeview Family Dental after hours. How can I help?\nAI: How can I assist you today?\nUser: Yeah. Bye.\nAI: Goodbye. Have a great day.\nUser: Well, well,\nAI: Is there if you need assistance, feel free to let me know.\nUser: Yeah. How's your targeting?\nAI: I'm here to assist, uh, with any questions or concerns about, uh, Lakeview family Dental. Uh, how can I help you? Hello. How can I assist?\nUser: How's your parking?\nAI: Parking is free in the lot behind the building.\nUser: Harcia Park.\nAI: Lakeview family\nUser: He offered Are you open on Saturday and Sunday?\nAI: No. We are closed on, uh, on Saturdays and Sundays. Our office hours are Monday to Thursday, 8 AM to 5 PM. And Friday, 8 AM to 1 PM.\nUser: Great. Thank you very much. Bye.\nAI: You're welcome. Have a great day. Goodbye.\n",
    "messages": [
